      <title>美国8月私人新增就业仅3.8万 远低于预期</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260902/%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD8%E6%9C%88%E7%A7%81%E4%BA%BA%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%9A%E4%BB%853.8%E4%B8%87-%E8%BF%9C%E4%BD%8E%E4%BA%8E%E9%A2%84%E6%9C%9F/</link>
